./ I 00480000 $ 00480020 020                                                    
*  SUBCHANNEL DISCOVERY. ESA/390 REPLACES THE CHANNEL AND      XA0013DK         
*  UNIT ADDRESS WITH A SUBCHANNEL NUMBER, AND NOTHING IN THE   XA0013DK         
*  DIRECTORY KNOWS IT, SO IT HAS TO BE LEARNED. FOR EACH       XA0013DK         
*  SUBCHANNEL: STSCH, AND IF IT IS PROVIDED AND VALID, TAKE    XA0013DK         
*  ITS DEVICE NUMBER, FIND THE RDEVBLOK, RECORD THE SUBSYSTEM  XA0013DK         
*  ID, AND MSCH TO ENABLE IT AND SET THE INTERRUPTION          XA0013DK         
*  PARAMETER TO THE DEVICE ADDRESS -- WHICH IS WHAT DMKIOT     XA0013DK         
*  READS AT IOINTPRM+2. ENABLE AND PARAMETER GO IN ONE MSCH    XA0013DK         
*  BECAUSE A SUBCHANNEL RESET CLEARS BOTH.                     XA0013DK         
         LA    R4,CPISCHIB    THE SCHIB WE PROBE INTO          XA0013DK         
         USING SCHIBLOK,R4                                     XA0013DK         
         SR    R2,R2          FIRST SUBCHANNEL NUMBER          XA0013DK         
         LA    R3,CPINSCH     HOW MANY TO PROBE                XA0013DK         
CPIDISC  DS    0H                                              XA0013DK         
         L     R1,CPISSID0    X'00010000'                      XA0013DK         
         OR    R1,R2          OR IN THE SUBCHANNEL NUMBER      XA0013DK         
         STSCH 0(R4)          STORE SUBCHANNEL                 XA0013DK         
         BC    7,CPIDISCN     NOT CC0: NOT PROVIDED, SKIP      XA0013DK         
         TM    PMCWFLG5,PMCW5V IS THE SUBCHANNEL VALID ?       XA0013DK         
         BZ    CPIDISCN       NO, NO DEVICE BEHIND IT          XA0013DK         
         STM   R1,R3,CPIDSAVE SAVE SSID, SCHNO AND COUNT       XA0013DK         
         LH    R1,PMCWDEV     DEVICE NUMBER FROM THE PMCW      XA0013DK         
         CALL  DMKSCNRU       FIND THE RCH, RCU AND RDEV       XA0013DK         
         LM    R1,R3,CPIDSAVE RESTORE -- LM LEAVES THE CC      XA0013DK         
         BNZ   CPIDISCN       NO RDEVBLOK FOR THIS DEVICE      XA0013DK         
         USING RDEVBLOK,R8                                     XA0013DK         
         ST    R1,RDEVSSID    REMEMBER THIS DEVICE'S SSID      XA0013DK         
         XC    PMCWPARM,PMCWPARM CLEAR THE PARAMETER           XA0013DK         
         MVC   PMCWPARM+2(2),RDEVADD DEV ADDR, LOW HALF        XA0013DK         
         OI    PMCWFLG5,PMCW5E ENABLE THE SUBCHANNEL           XA0013DK         
         MSCH  0(R4)          MODIFY SUBCHANNEL                XA0013DK         
         DROP  R8                                              XA0013DK         
CPIDISCN DS    0H             NEXT SUBCHANNEL                  XA0013DK         
         LA    R2,1(0,R2)     BUMP THE SUBCHANNEL NUMBER       XA0013DK         
         BCT   R3,CPIDISC     PROBE THE WHOLE RANGE            XA0013DK         
         DROP  R4                                              XA0013DK         
./ R 00593000          $ 00593100 100                                           
*  SSK DOES NOT EXIST IN ESA/390, SO THE FIRST ONE TOOK AN     XA0013DK         
*  OPERATION EXCEPTION INTO THIS LOOP'S OWN EXIT AND SIZED     XA0013DK         
*  STORAGE AT ZERO. SSKE IS THE 4 KB COUNTERPART AND TAKES     XA0013DK         
*  THE SAME REGISTERS. I-104.                                  XA0013DK         
KEYLOOP  SSKE  R2,R5          AND SET STORAGE KEYS             XA0013DK         
./ R 00613000          $ 00613100 100                                           
*  WAS DC X'E612',S(0(R3),0) -- STORE CP ASSIST LEVEL, THE     XA0013DK         
*  PROBE. ON ESA/390 THERE ARE NO ASSISTS, SO TAKE THE         XA0013DK         
*  NO-ASSIST PATH DIRECTLY INSTEAD OF PROVOKING AN OPERATION   XA0013DK         
*  EXCEPTION TO FIND OUT. I-114.                               XA0013DK         
         B     CPIPINT2       NO ECPS:VM ON ESA/390            XA0013DK         
         BCR   0,0            PAD TO THE SIX BYTES E612 HELD   XA0013DK         
./ R 00615000          $ 00615100 100                                           
*  WAS LCTL C6,C6,ZEROES -- NO CP ASSIST UNTIL IPL COMPLETE.   XA0013DK         
*  ZERO IS NOW NO I/O INTERRUPTIONS AT ALL.                    XA0013DK         
         LCTL  C6,C6,CPCREG6  IO SUBCLASS MASK, NOT AN ASSIST  XA0013DK         
./ R 00619000          $ 00619100 100                                           
*  WAS MVC CPCREG6,ZEROES -- CLEAR CP ASSIST ENABLE FLAG.      XA0013DK         
*  CPCREG6 IS THE IO SUBCLASS MASK NOW AND MUST NOT BE         XA0013DK         
*  CLEARED; THE ASSIST IS ALREADY OFF BECAUSE EVERY ECPS:VM    XA0013DK         
*  OPCODE IS S/370-ONLY.                                       XA0013DK         
         DS    0H             THE CLEAR IS GONE, NOT MOVED     XA0013DK         
./ R 01045000          $ 01045100 100                                           
CPIHIO   XAHIO R15            ISSUE HIO                        XA0013DK         
./ R 01053000 01056000 $ 01053100 100                                           
         XATIO R15            TO CLEAR HEX 70 STATUS           XA0013DK         
         XATIO R15            FROM 3705                        XA0013DK         
         XATIO R15            (CODE FOR 3705 ONLY)             XA0013DK         
         XATIO R15                                             XA0013DK         
./ R 01069000          $ 01069100 100                                           
CPITIO1  XATIO R15            TIO                              XA0013DK         
./ R 01096000          $ 01096100 100                                           
CHKRSRL2 XASIO R15            ATTEMPT THE "RELEASE"            XA0013DK         
./ R 01111000          $ 01111100 100                                           
CHKRSRL3 XATIO R15            IF CONDITION-CODE 0,             XA0013DK         
./ R 01154000          $ 01154100 100                                           
CPISIO1  XASIO R15            ISSUE SIO                        XA0013DK         
./ R 01166000          $ 01166100 100                                           
CPIALLOC XATIO R15            ISSUE TIO                        XA0013DK         
./ R 01200000          $ 01200100 100                                           
CPISIO3  XASIO R15            START THE READ                   XA0013DK         
./ R 01225000          $ 01225100 100                                           
CPSIO1   XASIO R15            SUSPEND IMMEDIATE                XA0013DK         
./ R 01231000          $ 01231100 100                                           
CPTIO    XATIO R15            CHECK OUT STATUS,CC=0            XA0013DK         
./ R 01239000          $ 01239100 100                                           
CPIOWNA  XATIO R15            DRAIN FOR CE/DE                  XA0013DK         
./ R 01568000          $ 01568100 100                                           
SNSIO    XASIO R15            ISSUE SENSE COMMAND              XA0013DK         
./ R 01587000          $ 01587100 100                                           
SNTIO    XATIO R15            CLEAR THE SUBCHANNEL             XA0013DK         
./ R 01653000          $ 01653100 100                                           
         LCTL  C6,C6,CPCREG6  IO SUBCLASS MASK, NOT A MICBLOK  XA0013DK         
./ R 01674000          $ 01674100 100                                           
*  WAS LCTL C6,C6,ZEROES -- RESET ASSIST CONTROL REGISTER.     XA0013DK         
*  THE VERY NEXT THING THIS MODULE DOES IS WRITE THE CONSOLE   XA0013DK         
*  MESSAGE, WHICH NEEDS AN I/O INTERRUPTION. I-71.             XA0013DK         
         LCTL  C6,C6,CPCREG6  RE-ASSERT THE IO SUBCLASS MASK   XA0013DK         
./ R 01719000          $ 01719100 100                                           
         XATIO R15            MAKE SURE IT EXISTS              XA0013DK         
./ R 01723000 01724000 $ 01723100 100                                           
STRTGRF  XATIO R15            TEST DEVICE                      XA0013DK         
         BC    2,STRTGRF      LOOP IF BUSY                     XA0013DK         
./ R 01726000          $ 01726100 100                                           
STRTSIO  XASIO R15            START SENSE TO DEVICE            XA0013DK         
./ R 01749000          $ 01749010 010                                           
*  WAS LCTL C2,C2,... -- LOAD OUR NEW MASK. CR2 IS THE DUCT    XA0013DK         
*  ORIGIN ON ESA/390. THE WAIT IS GOVERNED BY THE PSW I/O BIT  XA0013DK         
*  AND CR6. I-73.                                              XA0013DK         
         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE                 XA0013DK         
./ R 01752000          $ 01752010 010                                           
*  WAS LCTL C2,C2,... -- RESTORE CTRL REG. CR2 IS THE DUCT     XA0013DK         
*  ORIGIN ON ESA/390. THE WAIT IS GOVERNED BY THE PSW I/O BIT  XA0013DK         
*  AND CR6. I-73.                                              XA0013DK         
         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE                 XA0013DK         
./ R 01758000          $ 01758100 100                                           
TSTGRF   XATIO R15            TEST FOR SENSE END               XA0013DK         
./ I 01761000 $ 01761010 010                                                    
*  XAIO WORK AREAS AND LOOKUP. XABLOKS IS ALREADY COPIED AT    XA0013DK         
*  03506100, AND ORBCCWFM IS USED THERE AS AN MVI IMMEDIATE,   XA0013DK         
*  WHICH XF RESOLVES AS A FORWARD REFERENCE -- UNLIKE A        XA0013DK         
*  LENGTH MODIFIER. I-51.                                      XA0013DK         
         XAIOWORK             XAIO WORK AREAS AND LOOKUP       XA0013DK         
./ R 01898000          $ 01898010 010                                           
XWAIT1   DC    X'000A000000000006' EC MODE. I-107.             XA0013DK         
./ R 01899000          $ 01899010 010                                           
XWAIT2   DC    X'000A000000000005' EC MODE. I-107.             XA0013DK         
./ R 01900000          $ 01900010 010                                           
XWAIT3   DC    X'000A00000000000D' EC MODE. I-107.             XA0013DK         
./ R 01901500          $ 01901510 010                                           
XWAIT9   DC    X'000A000000000009' EC MODE. I-107.             XA0013DK         
./ R 01902000          $ 01902010 010                                           
XWAIT4   DC    X'000A000000000015' EC MODE. I-107.             XA0013DK         
./ R 01902100          $ 01902110 010                                           
XWAITCSS DC    X'000A000000000016' EC MODE. I-107.             XA0013DK         
./ R 01928000 01929000 $ 01928100 100                                           
*  CR2 HELD X'FFFFFFFF' AS THE S/370 CHANNEL MASK. ON ESA/390  XA0013DK         
*  CR2 IS THE DISPATCHABLE-UNIT-CONTROL-TABLE ORIGIN AND MUST  XA0013DK         
*  NOT CARRY THAT, WHILE CR6 IS THE I/O-INTERRUPTION SUBCLASS  XA0013DK         
*  MASK AND WAS ZERO -- MEANING NO I/O INTERRUPTION IS EVER    XA0013DK         
*  PRESENTED. CP WOULD IPL, ISSUE A GOOD SSCH AND WAIT         XA0013DK         
*  FOREVER, WITH NOTHING FLAGGED ANYWHERE. THE MASK THEREFORE  XA0013DK         
*  MOVES FROM CR2 TO CR6. ALL EIGHT SUBCLASSES ARE ENABLED;    XA0013DK         
*  SUBCHANNELS DEFAULT TO ISC 0.                               XA0013DK         
         DC    F'0'           CR2 -- DUCT ORIGIN, NOT A MASK   XA0013DK         
         DC    3F'0'          CR3, CR4, CR5                    XA0013DK         
         DC    X'FF000000'    CR6 -- IO SUBCLASS MASK          XA0013DK         
         DC    7F'0'          CR7 THROUGH CR13                 XA0013DK         
./ I 01930000 $ 01930050 050                                                    
*  WORK AREAS FOR SUBCHANNEL DISCOVERY. THE SCHIB MUST BE      XA0013DK         
*  FULLWORD ALIGNED -- BOTH STSCH AND MSCH TAKE A              XA0013DK         
*  SPECIFICATION EXCEPTION OTHERWISE.                          XA0013DK         
CPISCHIB DS    13F            52 BYTES = SCHIBSIZ, FULLWORD    XA0013DK         
*  ALIGNED.  13F RATHER THAN XL(SCHIBSIZ) BECAUSE XABLOKS IS   XA0013DK         
*  COPIED AFTER THIS POINT AND A LENGTH MODIFIER CANNOT BE A   XA0013DK         
*  FORWARD REFERENCE -- IFO231.  I-51.                         XA0013DK         
CPIDSAVE DS    3F             SSID, SCHNO, COUNT               XA0013DK         
CPISSID0 DC    X'00010000'    SUBSYSTEM ID PREFIX, LCSS 0      XA0013DK         
CPINSCH  EQU   256            SUBCHANNELS PROBED AT IPL        XA0013DK         
./ R 02785000          $ 02785010 010                                           
*  WAS TIMETEST EQU * -- THE HEAD OF A POLL ON THE INTERVAL    XA0013DK         
*  TIMER AT X'50'. 370-XA DELETED THAT TIMER (PoO APPENDIX     XA0013DK         
*  F), SO THE VALUE NEVER CHANGES, THE TEST NEVER PASSES, AND  XA0013DK         
*  CP SAT IN TLOOP1 WRITING 'TURN ON THE INTERVAL TIMER'       XA0013DK         
*  FOREVER. THE LOOP BELOW IS LEFT IN PLACE AND UNREACHABLE:   XA0013DK         
*  TLOOP1, TLOOP AND NOMPMSG ARE STILL BRANCH TARGETS FURTHER  XA0013DK         
*  DOWN. THE CPU TIMER AND CLOCK COMPARATOR DO EXIST AND CP    XA0013DK         
*  ALREADY USES STPT AND SPT, SO THIS REMOVES A START-UP GATE  XA0013DK         
*  AND NOT CP'S TIMEKEEPING. WALL 19, I-178.                   XA0013DK         
TIMETEST DS    0H             NOTHING TO TEST ANY MORE         XA0013DK         
         B     TIMERON        STRAIGHT PAST THE DEAD POLL      XA0013DK         
./ I 03506100 $ 03506110 010                                                    
         COPY  XABLOKS                                         XA0013DK         
